## 🌟 About the Project

**Sales Performance Analytics Dashboard** is an intermediate-level Data Analytics project built using **Python, Pandas, NumPy, MySQL, Plotly, and Streamlit**.

It transforms sales data into an interactive dashboard to analyze:

📈 Sales & Profit  
📦 Products  
👥 Customers  
🌍 Regions  
🏷️ Categories  
💰 Discounts  
📊 Business KPIs  

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

| 🎯 Objective | 📌 Description |
|---|---|
| 📈 Sales Analysis | Identify sales trends and growth |
| 💰 Profit Analysis | Analyze profitability and margins |
| 📦 Product Analysis | Find top & low-performing products |
| 🌍 Regional Analysis | Compare regional performance |
| 👥 Customer Analysis | Identify valuable customers |
| 🏷️ Category Analysis | Compare category performance |
| 💡 Business Insights | Generate data-driven insights |

---

## 🚀 Key Features

✨ **Interactive Filters**

- 📅 Date Range
- 🌍 Region
- 📍 State
- 🏷️ Category
- 📦 Product
- 💳 Payment Mode

### 📊 KPI Cards

💰 Total Sales  
📈 Total Profit  
🧾 Total Orders  
📦 Quantity Sold  
💵 Average Order Value  
📊 Profit Margin  

### 📈 Interactive Visualizations

- 📈 Monthly Sales Trend
- 💰 Monthly Profit Trend
- 🌍 Sales by Region
- 🏷️ Sales by Category
- 📦 Top 10 Products
- 🏆 Top Profitable Products
- 📉 Bottom Performing Products
- 👥 Customer Analysis
- 🎯 Discount vs Profit
- 📊 Sales vs Quantity

